                                                "sense_id": "0abe3390-c6fb-324b-b48e-80a76e54f79e",
                                                "text": "— Our opponents may be younger, faster and less out of shape than we are, but we have something they’ll never have!\n— Tenure?\n— Tenacity!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f66d89ca-ba10-339e-b195-d3405f7dd3b2",
