                                                "sense_id": "a0e0d061-484b-306a-95d5-b474fd517988",
                                                "text": "The persistence of the number 39 under the operation of multiplying the digits of the number is three, because 3x9 = 27, 2x7 = 14, and 1x4 = 4, and no further iterations will change the number again."
